From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Julien Etienne <julien.etienne@gmail.com>
Date: Tue, 3 Nov 2026 23:13:25 -0500
Subject: [PATCH] soc: mediatek: mt6797-consys: stop the STP tick before the
 interrupts

Halt clears the BTIF interrupt enables, then deletes the timer. A tick in
between can pump and write the enables back. Delete the timer first.
---
 drivers/soc/mediatek/mt6797-consys.c | 3 ++-
 1 file changed, 2 insertions(+), 1 deletion(-)

diff --git a/drivers/soc/mediatek/mt6797-consys.c b/drivers/soc/mediatek/mt6797-consys.c
index 6bbef6bca..5e39e9f8f 100644
--- a/drivers/soc/mediatek/mt6797-consys.c
+++ b/drivers/soc/mediatek/mt6797-consys.c
@@ -2032,10 +2032,11 @@ static void mt6797_stp_halt(struct device *dev, struct mt6797_stp *s)
 			break;
 		msleep(20);
 	}
+	/* The timer first: a tick's pump can write the interrupt enables back. */
+	timer_delete_sync(&s->tick);
 	spin_lock_irqsave(&s->lock, flags);
 	writel(0, s->btif + WMT_BTIF_IER);
 	spin_unlock_irqrestore(&s->lock, flags);
-	timer_delete_sync(&s->tick);
 	free_irq(s->irq, s);
 	s->running = false;
 	dev_info(dev,
-- 
2.43.0

